In what way?  The Mirror no longer has its ridiculous double-damage
bonus (I probably should've mentioned that) for spells, so while it
provides some functionality it's nothing special.  The Eye being a base
amulet of power means that the recharge effects are available simply by
waiting to find one on the ground -- or polymorphing amulets if you're
that sort.  And, more importantly... you have to wear an amulet of power
to get recharge effects.  (The Eye didn't confer ESP as a feature of the
Eye, it conferred it because its base item type was "amulet of ESP" --
you had to wear the Eye to get ESP in vanilla.)

All things considered, I don't see how the incentive to wish for
these two artifacts is any greater than in vanilla, where neutrals
should almost get the Eye as _mandatory_.

